ity<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/migrate-from-pipeline-variables-to-pipeline-inputs-for-better-security/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"migrate from pipeline variables to pipeline inputs for better security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><!--[-->Migrate from pipeline variables to pipeline inputs for better security<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><!--[-->Follow this guide to learn about stronger controls around pipeline customization, including how to implement explicit declarations, type safety, and validation.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/migrate-from-pipeline-variables-to-pipeline-inputs-for-better-security/","retrieved":1765313243935},{"title":"Delivering faster and smarter scans with Advanced SAST","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/delivering-faster-and-smarter-scans-with-advanced-sast/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"delivering faster and smarter scans with advanced sast\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-4d3fff66=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/